msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hehehe..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hehehe..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_30E5E1BB_B7F2_4FAF_BA5D_69954D3BD547
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc3a4588ba49b3071b0ddbb794736efd0c686aeed135d83273792ebe292c1f76
#. default-sha256: dd95934cf5b55b6e7814b3ed1a3b4ba32d7b9f49acd575cff86827fd30a5f5e2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_30E5E1BB_B7F2_4FAF_BA5D_69954D3BD547"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You know now who you are, do you not?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You remember everything now, do you "
"not?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ora lei sa chi è...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ricorda ogni cosa adesso, non è vero?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B194619B_C01B_4ED1_A384_43CC74CC0CBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a28254997c2d5f1382a93fbe6df7d5029900362d613d55db74dd77c649e1b40
#. default-sha256: 49453e2c4a14c8415c54ad2dc2da8cd0918a3392d80dcd7d73cf373ccc268589
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B194619B_C01B_4ED1_A384_43CC74CC0CBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You were present in every single era.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The reason for which is as I described in the "
"previous tale:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lei era presente in ogni singola epoca.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Per il motivo che le ho già spiegato "
"durante il precedente racconto:"

#: scenario4:scenario4_74CD1C8A_A4D5_41B2_9FA0_8BACE6033A72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 120dc0d159232f6f63e0c1937c7df6ea1bbb54e0c2d003340a32b628c208e604
#. default-sha256: bdc3e43d55b045ecc34d4926097f4069c03be03f6fdfb81bb200179902a4db8b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_74CD1C8A_A4D5_41B2_9FA0_8BACE6033A72"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫because you yearned to be reunited with someone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But that person never showed up—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫in any era."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫perché desiderava riunirsi con qualcuno.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ma quella persona non si è mai fatta viva—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫in nessuna epoca."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AF0F7A7E_BAC4_4A40_9E07_65C1528B46FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8a70530d18ba5323bdb915c2bfefebf2fb6f25098bb07c86d4ef2fdebbf18e0
#. default-sha256: 14d247f5928be40037ee93f1a24bed6dfde54c2d849673018c58110b1a26f235
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AF0F7A7E_BAC4_4A40_9E07_65C1528B46FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And poor, sweet you, having no memory of any of that..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E lei, povera, dolce creatura, senza alcuna memoria di tutto ciò..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E428239F_CEA7_4A3E_8AC2_7DB486476010
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 558cab12f7c87ec1d59f2db57b2c8df3bfc87c704546e9230d10e15118e8bf7d
#. default-sha256: b389027203e8d0d1b40a38d573b488159a4d82411ffdd174ce95c68511ee351e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E428239F_CEA7_4A3E_8AC2_7DB486476010"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫lived those lives with other men."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ha vissuto quelle vite con altri uomini."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D4DC32D_2721_4440_ACF6_FDC1CD804679
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: caa0a1df83529fbd8d7717c2a68b6e97a1643e0df385d68f7fe685bbae08b0f7
#. default-sha256: 2865d5bb03a1be25b2cfa9804c1456d0325488f8043868a5fb648dd9f6010378
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D4DC32D_2721_4440_ACF6_FDC1CD804679"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is it any surprise misfortune befell those eras, then?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫È⟪k:2⟫ forse una sorpresa che la disgrazia abbia colpito ognuna di quelle epoche?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7184B801_A9A2_4A5A_825E_52C1CB605614
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1723d3e1a151e313d8ceddbb6816627dd837085244fb48676cd0f91eabb524a
#. default-sha256: 111acdda6c9b1d832ab2f5d33ed10ad954a7274d84d3973507eddc0fea4b933e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7184B801_A9A2_4A5A_825E_52C1CB605614"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The door swung closed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La porta si richiuse."

#: scenario4:scenario4_93E5634F_9071_481C_80D5_5D5B3D1A7903
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 332a8b70f572404f3b8e5d33c097b33de504976557e57bbb9d2d553979ffcce7
#. default-sha256: cabefe993b87a9a64d7a2b8c28e5558e466afcf4476cd70cf0090148fa7fb8d5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_93E5634F_9071_481C_80D5_5D5B3D1A7903"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But rather than outside, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ and the Maid were inside the dull, "
"monochrome room at the top of the observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma anziché all’esterno, ⟪k:1⟫Tu⟪k:2⟫il Defunto⟪k:3⟫ e la Domestica ⟪k:4⟫vi trovavate⟪k:5⟫si "
"trovavano⟪k:6⟫ all’interno della sbiadita stanza monocromatica in cima alla torre d’osservazione."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E4A94C21_3189_4168_A05B_E2C567BCADA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14274174baf634f206c9ac59cf04c4e3a8c936739f23c2ef4b75d256c997bf10
#. default-sha256: 0c22df207cc4976973d1fc2c8cad4362b9834cf2e550f0bf429a9541f9de9a64
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E4A94C21_3189_4168_A05B_E2C567BCADA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The awe-inspiring ray of light shone not through the lone window high upon the stone wall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il solenne raggio di luce non risplendeva più attraverso la solitaria finestra in alto sul "
"muro di pietra."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9AD4ACE6_C165_4387_AB8B_965A367809DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a7500819bd65c55e01c6243a9caad5781a047cb61d5ad9b34f60b06326414698
#. default-sha256: 4eb9bcae600265707f1e63e6b678e7a10148d10c353b6f28ded615ae593c2ccf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9AD4ACE6_C165_4387_AB8B_965A367809DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Wrapped in a curious, impenetrable darkness, ⟪k:1⟫You both⟪k:2⟫they⟪k:3⟫ stood alone in the "
"room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avvolti da una curiosa e impenetrabile oscurità, ⟪k:1⟫eravate⟪k:2⟫erano⟪k:3⟫ da soli nella "
"stanza."

#: scenario4:scenario4_08082BEE_BF0F_49B8_B391_FFAFBAF0D488
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7413d1aa1ef3a8a1b21d92f1d1f4d49caf4b13c89bb1b1128b926da96b5d3dcd
#. default-sha256: 4cff8e23103b75325ea270766223dcc0082bb6563d28ff33ed83c416eec19b87
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_08082BEE_BF0F_49B8_B391_FFAFBAF0D488"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The Maid wore a gentle, but brittlely cold smile as she looked straight at ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫"
"him⟪k:3⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mentre ⟪k:1⟫Ti⟪k:2⟫lo⟪k:3⟫ guardava, la Domestica mostrò un sorriso gentile,⟪k:4⟫ma allo "
"stesso tempo freddo e fragile."

#: scenario4:scenario4_59DA248B_53B8_46EA_97ED_41E3205E4794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1555604679e7351391fd64800edcb1a90ad078a645259cb147fd2e7c770fa7d2
#. default-sha256: ccaf34ad40dae097425b2fd5c698cd0f98b0882e9b2b51491ff98ac0065fa165
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_59DA248B_53B8_46EA_97ED_41E3205E4794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It is not your fault misfortune befell you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The only force to blame for that "
"is fate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non è colpa sua se la disgrazia si è abbattuta su di lei.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫L’unica forza da "
"biasimare per tutto questo è il destino."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D698B4F1_1523_47BA_BDE8_52FD24FF397F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f516101b53e3c76a8e35d547b557fe4c4a6fb80e31150d4cbf9f65f6c66856a7
#. default-sha256: 0ceb0a864beaf576a60f76f93edf9c5e42678095c1c2849fcee07940ca9977ec
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D698B4F1_1523_47BA_BDE8_52FD24FF397F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You were always so kind, so pure of heart.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You had boundless trust for others and "
"the goodness of people."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Lei era sempre così gentile, così pura di cuore.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nutriva una fiducia sconfinata "
"nelle persone e nella loro bontà."

#: scenario4:scenario4_43F9E646_DBDF_49D5_B6CA_BB446B46B564
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5c0238efe823ff9332976ddb1de6ef75b28576d0cad8eb3e988634353febc96
#. default-sha256: c09c5f7d5b0b3b6647f05f51d23b952e3d0cad7a0cb6757c7c05de5d6aaec4f3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_43F9E646_DBDF_49D5_B6CA_BB446B46B564"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You were the very image of all that is right."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Lei era la rappresentazione di tutto ciò che è giusto."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7DF46AD4_9E5C_41C1_82A9_9EB6AD8E4082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce240b9dd1d9ceca201797de90e58100380eb0fef2629b5d74fc6ebe5a48d0aa
#. default-sha256: 646c95686dc373af380315157be16dc46be6b91b8cb374ef8d9301ba0bb345bf
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7DF46AD4_9E5C_41C1_82A9_9EB6AD8E4082"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There is no greater misfortune⟪k:2⟫than someone as pure and beautiful as you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non c’è sfortuna più grande per una persona così pura e graziosa⟪k:2⟫come lei..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FCEF73D5_C5F0_4551_8C80_48C163A936CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 16398d258db25573cf87cf23d938657bcbd9bd904787190a6854b1af5f8b90f2
#. default-sha256: 382a6dae3f35ae2c13c2d9740ca53e2f3aa6186e1c2fb9fec0cfef988c29189b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FCEF73D5_C5F0_4551_8C80_48C163A936CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫being mercilessly thrown into the grinding gears of tragedy again and again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫dell’essere gettata senza pietà negli ingranaggi della disgrazia⟪k:1⟫ancora e ancora."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8DB36CD3_1590_4FC9_9E01_681A33745D42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a9e2a2cf4f915dcea6d356d3ce3f2c57044bf1a9dcf37dfd319518079ef8cd4
#. default-sha256: 4dab0ab59df46f92c315d6a86ab4d14e382a6bf5a1c85420ee06f36c4a129190
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8DB36CD3_1590_4FC9_9E01_681A33745D42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I still pity you for everything you had to go through.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You poor, poor soul..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Continuo a provare pena per lei,⟪k:2⟫per tutto quello che ha dovuto passare.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Povera anima..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_067B98EE_A44C_4082_9288_94B79A32DC58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf54862b40c7d89ea157f3c2870015dd05b192cbb1289c15e96d50e482da7380
#. default-sha256: 9da17559187255caa92bd4b2c66d965e9e070112405f85ce79792a4a4ae6d791
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_067B98EE_A44C_4082_9288_94B79A32DC58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You must be utterly exhausted.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Constantly betrayed, the man you were waiting "
"for never appearing..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dev’essere parecchio esausta.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Costantemente tradita dall’uomo che lei ha "
"atteso così a lungo,⟪k:4⟫e che non è mai riapparso..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_405E2969_551B_4028_B181_8523B24F36F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 090dd6dd4d0f3dcc992f16468d659403b0b0b89f2af9f97c02c7c9a7f6823016
#. default-sha256: 8ebf220d212f18a1ab1935eadb79686457d0eb29379783580fe9a0b42272ef94
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_405E2969_551B_4028_B181_8523B24F36F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After so long, your spirit worn down to the bone, you lost any and all awareness of who you "
"even were."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dopo tutto questo tempo, il suo spirito si è ridotto all’osso,⟪k:1⟫facendole perdere ogni "
"consapevolezza di sé."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7A11065A_99DF_414F_B190_24DA34064DD5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 52c83f1e6f5cf60971ab2b08b0696e99c46b0cead05222c98bd1f6116ed0533f
#. default-sha256: b8be731d197f1ac16d6d3edbec3dc933dd290fe55462e1929ce0b389fb8e060f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7A11065A_99DF_414F_B190_24DA34064DD5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Who were you hoping to find wandering into this illusory mansion, cut off from the real "
"world?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Chi sperava di trovare vagando in questa villa illusoria,⟪k:2⟫separata dal mondo reale?"

