msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And yes... ⟪k:2⟫that means precisely what you think it does:⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫that I have "
"accepted you as my new master.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫That I wish for you to remain here."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E sì... ⟪k:2⟫ciò significa esattamente quello che immagina:⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫che l’ho accettata "
"come mio nuovo padrone.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Che desidero che lei rimanga qui."

#: scenario4:scenario4_64A0889C_8CE4_4672_BB47_145C028D4202
