#: scenario4:scenario4_590C7DF6_DB76_420D_9175_E9571739B519
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4bd55cdf12d003f94a7039bd214226435a08a9127b116ce8c043dc60bee40bd
