#: scenario4:scenario4_75D0E684_F5AF_4F47_82D5_DB232C826D14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd1b3ec93d8bf30848c438834116a95b1d21c688393aebb9d8d72a7e6ef2d3e7
